# Pairs with NoTrimPastLiveNeed. The trim ignores a Zero block pin, so a leaf that
# has written but never checkpointed is trimmed past.
MODULE: NoTrimPastLiveNeedTrimIgnoresBlockPin
TARGET: NoTrimPastLiveNeed
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the trim does not stop at a block pin
PERTURBS: GcTrim

--- FIND
GcTrim ==
    /\ ~Blocking
--- REPLACE
GcTrim ==
\* MUTATION: block pins do not stop the trim.
    /\ TRUE
--- END
